					<description><![CDATA[As his sister Sarah’s friend Nikki said of this photo:  “he looks so relaxed.”  Becoming a pilot was a dream come true.  He loved every minute in the air, and he and I would talk about all his latest adventures during every phone call.  After he started his flying lessons, he told me that had he started flying lessons as a teenager, he would have become a pilot instead of an engineer.]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>As his sister Sarah’s friend Nikki said of this photo:  “he looks so relaxed.”  Becoming a pilot was a dream come true.  He loved every minute in the air, and he and I would talk about all his latest adventures during every phone call.  After he started his flying lessons, he told me that had he started flying lessons as a teenager, he would have become a pilot instead of an engineer.</p>
